        <object id="pc" label="makeColumnView" tooltip="ColumnView makeColumnView(const unsigned* values, unsigned rows, unsigned columns, unsigned column)&#10;&#10;Purpose&#10;Build a view of one column with the first element, row count, and stride.&#10;&#10;Parameters&#10;- values: The row-major grid.&#10;- rows: The number of rows in the grid.&#10;- columns: The number of columns in the grid.&#10;- column: The zero-based column index.&#10;&#10;Source&#10;demo/grid.cc:24">
